1
00:03:24,444 --> 00:03:30,444
The Original Entourage

2
00:06:48,888 --> 00:06:54,888
Alvin and the Chipmunks is a comedy, family, fantasy film directed by Tim Hill.

3
00:10:13,333 --> 00:10:19,333
A struggling songwriter named Dave Seville finds success when he comes across a trio of singing
chipmunks: mischievous leader Alvin, brainy Simon, and chubby, impressionable Theodore.

4
00:13:37,777 --> 00:13:43,777
Dave, played by Jason Lee.

5
00:17:02,222 --> 00:17:08,222
Ian, played by David Cross.

6
00:20:26,666 --> 00:20:32,666
Claire, played by Cameron Richardson.

7
00:23:51,111 --> 00:23:57,111
Gail, played by Jane Lynch.

8
00:27:15,555 --> 00:27:21,555
Alvin (voice), played by Justin Long.

9
00:30:40,000 --> 00:30:46,000
Simon (voice), played by Matthew Gray Gubler.

10
00:34:04,444 --> 00:34:10,444
Alvin and the Chipmunks is a 2007 American live-action animated jukebox musical
comedy film based on the characters created by Ross Bagdasarian Sr..

11
00:37:28,888 --> 00:37:34,888
Directed by Tim Hill, and written by Jon Vitti, Will McRobb, and Chris Viscardi, it is the
first installment in the Alvin and the Chipmunks live-action film series.

12
00:40:53,333 --> 00:40:59,333
The cast includes Jason Lee, David Cross, and Cameron Richardson, while Justin
Long, Matthew Gray Gubler, and Jesse McCartney voice the chipmunks.

13
00:44:17,777 --> 00:44:23,777
The plot follows chipmunks (Alvin, Simon, and Theodore), who move in with
struggling songwriter Dave Seville after losing their home.

14
00:47:42,222 --> 00:47:48,222
When Dave discovers their singing talent, he introduces them to JETT Records executive
Ian Hawke, whose plans threaten the chipmunks' newfound family dynamic.

15
00:51:06,666 --> 00:51:12,666
Development began in 1997 when Ross Bagdasarian Jr.

16
00:54:31,111 --> 00:54:37,111
expressed interest in creating a live-action film.

17
00:57:55,555 --> 00:58:01,555
The project saw multiple changes before it was announced in September 2004 as a collaboration
between Fox 2000 Pictures, 20th Century Fox Animation, and Bagdasarian Company.

18
01:01:20,000 --> 01:01:26,000
The animation for the film was handled by Rhythm & Hues Studios, which studied real chipmunks and
previous versions of the characters to design CGI models that retained their original essence.

19
01:04:44,444 --> 01:04:50,444
The integration of CGI with live-action footage required
match-moving techniques and advanced visual effects software.

20
01:08:08,888 --> 01:08:14,888
The music was composed by Christopher Lennertz.

21
01:11:33,333 --> 01:11:39,333
The film is dedicated to the memory of Ross
Bagdasarian, creator of the Chipmunks.

22
01:14:57,777 --> 01:15:03,777
Alvin and the Chipmunks was released in the United States
on December 14, 2007, by 20th Century Fox.

23
01:18:22,222 --> 01:18:28,222
Despite receiving negative reviews from critics, it grossed $365
million worldwide against a $55–60 million budget.

24
01:21:46,666 --> 01:21:52,666
The film's commercial success led to three sequels: The Squeakquel in
2009, Chipwrecked in 2011, and The Road Chip in 2015.

25
01:25:11,111 --> 01:25:17,111
The film explores themes of friendship, concert, pop star, approach, pop.

26
01:28:35,555 --> 01:28:41,555
The tone is lighthearted.
